          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most garages, buy one gallon of Oil Eater Original and use it at two strengths: light for the whole floor, strong for the drip zones. If you are cleaning a whole driveway, Zep ZUCON128 is the more economical concentrate, and if the pressure washer is coming out, Krud Kutter 385466 is built to run through it.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
